title: Quill SCRIPT-reconstruction skill + atelier reconstruct CLI verb
summary: 'Added canonical Quill skill (reconstruct-script-from-transcript.md) plus a thin atelier reconstruct [project-dir] CLI verb. The verb chains atelier transcribe via the exported transcribeProject helper in-process when no transcript exists, then prints a one-screen hint to invoke @atelier-quill in Claude Code. The CLI deliberately invokes no LLM — Quill does the reasoning over the transcript inside Claude Code. Updated Quill''s system prompt + Claude Code agent wrapper + atelier-agent-templates.ts snapshot with one sentence under My craft about reconstruction. Skills README updated. Two new aspects pinned to #cli-reconstruct in packages/cli/.purpose: reconstruct-chains-transcribe-if-needed and reconstruct-no-llm-call-from-cli. Veteran hero path''s first move.'
